    Prompt recorder: a filament switch posts the filament menu's chat note

    The "switch" step added in 3dee824967 called the filament switch the
    header uses, but not the note the filament menu posts into the chat when
    the person closes it (StatusRow::on_filament_visit). The request after a
    filament switch therefore lacked the developer message the app sends:
    "Filament is now Generic PLA. Heat and cooling follow PLA; walls and
    infill unchanged. Slice again when ready."

    The step now ends the menu visit the same way. The printer menu posts no
    note, so a printer switch is unchanged.

    Tests: the three-conversation switch script records with HARNESS RESULT
    PASS. Both filament cases now carry that developer message after the
    person's words; the printer case does not.

    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M7RZD103DY5ANQ3MHWEFQP2K

